WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:07.120
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain a Chinese comedy fantasy film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:15.920
called “Ri Chang Huan Xiang Zhi Nan.”&nbsp;
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:24.960
The protagonist of the movie is a con artist named&nbsp;
A Zhen. At the beginning of the movie, he steals a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:31.440
historic statue from a well-secured museum. The&nbsp;
statue has several superstitions attached to it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:37.440
as people believe that whoever has owned it in&nbsp;
the past has gone crazy in one way or the other.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:42.560
After successfully getting his hands on the said&nbsp;
valuable, Zhen goes to meet his business partner,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:47.920
brother Hei. He sells him other prehistoric&nbsp;
things that he has collected in the museum but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:54.640
keeps the statue to himself. Brother Hei’s client&nbsp;
Adam is furious that he didn’t get the statue.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:59.760
Later at night, Zhen is trying to start his car&nbsp;
when he notices that a car on the other side&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:06.080
of the road is slipping downhill. As he tries to&nbsp;
stop it, lightning strikes him and knocks him out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:11.120
A flashback of his childhood shows us that when&nbsp;
he was little, his principal had punished him for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:17.120
stealing money from his wallet although it was a&nbsp;
prank set by his friends. Zhen was humiliated in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:23.520
front of the entire school. That day, in a fit of&nbsp;
rage, he had asked God to hit him with lightning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:29.200
if he had stolen the money. Back in the present,&nbsp;
he wakes up in his bed. To his surprise, the veins&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:34.080
on his arms have turned red and prominent.&nbsp;
Zhen doesn’t think much of it and opens the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:39.840
fridge. At first glance, he sees someone’s face&nbsp;
inside it but when he looks again, it is gone.
&nbsp;

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:46.160
Similarly, after his pees, the toilet turns&nbsp;
into a human and starts talking. Zhen is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:51.920
beyond surprised. He walks out of the washroom&nbsp;
but hears his couch talking. Even his cat asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:58.080
him to get him a female cat. Soon, all the&nbsp;
objects in his room, including his TV, plants,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:05.680
decorations, start to talk. Zhen quickly packs&nbsp;
up the valuable statue and runs outside. He sees&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:12.480
a man peeing in his car and scolds him but the man&nbsp;
turns out to be a stray dog. Zen starts to believe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:18.160
that the lightning struck to his head has made&nbsp;
him go insane. He hurriedly gets into his car and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:24.320
drives away in a rush. Some seconds later, his&nbsp;
car turns into an old man who asks him to drive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:30.720
slowly. He sits beside Zhen in the front seat,&nbsp;
smiling at him. Zhen stops the car and runs to a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:36.400
beach holding the bag that has the statue in it.&nbsp;
When he opens the bag, the statue talks to him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:42.240
The human form of the statue comes to life and&nbsp;
calls Zhen out for stealing him. Following that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:47.440
Zhen goes to the doctor to get his head&nbsp;
checked. The doctor happens to be the principal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:52.400
who once accused him of stealing his money. When&nbsp;
the doctor refuses to believe that Zhen can talk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:58.880
to things and animals, his computer turns into&nbsp;
a human and talks to Zhen. Using the computer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:03.680
Zhen tells the doctor about all the promiscuous&nbsp;
movies that are saved on his computer. 
&nbsp;

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:09.120
The doctor is left stunned. Now that the guy knows&nbsp;
that he is a pervert, the doctor suggests that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:15.120
he go to a psychiatrist. As Zhen is leaving the&nbsp;
doctor’s office, he bumps into his childhood crush&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:21.200
and friend, Wang Caomei. She recognizes him&nbsp;
instantly and the two chat for a short time.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:25.680
Zheng asks her about any disease that&nbsp;
may cause people to talk to objects.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:32.880
Caomei only laughs at him and gives him her&nbsp;
card. After the brief encounter, Zhen’s mood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:39.360
has gotten exponentially better. He asks his car&nbsp;
to talk to him but it refuses. Some minutes later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:44.800
it stops in the middle of the road. When Zhen&nbsp;
gets out to check, the engine explodes sending&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:51.040
him flying to the ground. Somehow, the statue has&nbsp;
landed safely on the road. The human form appears&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:56.480
and tells Zhen that he should practice good virtue&nbsp;
and return all the things he has stolen. Only,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.480 --> 00:04:01.440
then the objects will stop talking to him.&nbsp;
A while later, the repairmen are called and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:06.560
the car is taken to the garage. Zheng wants it to&nbsp;
be repaired but the mechanic says that replacing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:12.320
parts to such an old vehicle is not possible so&nbsp;
he should demolish it. After it is taken away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:17.680
Zhen notices a red mask on the road. 
The mask talks to him and informs him of four&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:23.200
robbers who are on their way to rob a jewelry&nbsp;
shop. The scene shifts to a van where the said&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:28.320
robbers are driving to the said jewelry shop.&nbsp;
One of them has lost his mask so they kidnap a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:34.320
woman and use her tights as a mask. However, when&nbsp;
they reach the shop, the police are already there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:39.440
waiting for them. A few hours ago, Zhen was at&nbsp;
the police station to inform the police about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:44.400
the robbers that the mask had told him about. The&nbsp;
police inspector thought he was a freak at first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:52.480
but when Zhen communicated with his office table,&nbsp;
he believed him. After the robbers are caught,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:58.320
the police officer asks Zhen to call his next of&nbsp;
kin, believing him to be a mentally ill person.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:03.120
He calls Caomei to the police station who makes&nbsp;
the police officer understand that Zhen is not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:08.320
in his right mind. They then go to the beach where&nbsp;
Zhen tells her everything that has happened to him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:13.200
until then. Caomei refuses to believe him&nbsp;
and predicts that he is suffering from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:18.240
Schizophrenia. She says that she is ready to&nbsp;
help him get back to his normal mental state.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:23.440
Zhen agrees to act like he is mentally ill hoping&nbsp;
it will give him a chance to get closer to Caomei.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:30.480
When she leaves, a lightning bolt strikes the&nbsp;
park bench he was sitting on seconds ago. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:35.440
bench’s human form chases Zhen, accusing&nbsp;
him of being the reason he was struck. 
&nbsp;

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:40.000
At night, Zhen goes to put the statue back in the&nbsp;
museum hoping that it will make him go back to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:44.720
normal. The human form of the statue tells him&nbsp;
that since he is doing this for his own good,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:50.880
it won’t help him. Still, Zhen keeps the statue&nbsp;
in the museum and leaves. The next day brother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:55.440
Hei finds out that the statue was returned&nbsp;
by the thief. He is being pressured by his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.440 --> 00:06:00.720
associates to get a hold of the statue as soon&nbsp;
as possible because he has already accepted half&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:05.680
of the money. Meanwhile, Caomei holds a meeting&nbsp;
with all the doctors of the hospital, including&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:11.200
the former principal, to discuss Zhen’s condition.&nbsp;
The doctors, however, dismiss her concern,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:16.400
saying that Zhen is faking his illness to get&nbsp;
closer to her. Except for the former principal,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:21.920
who supports her view and allows her to help&nbsp;
him. At night, Zhen goes to an old temple to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:27.520
return a book he had stolen. He sees a group of&nbsp;
monks training but they happen to be statues.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:32.320
The chief monk takes the book from him and&nbsp;
praises Zhen for doing the right thing. 
&nbsp;

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:36.720
The following day, Caomei brings him&nbsp;
to a field when it is about to rain.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:41.280
She makes him wear an antenna so the lightning&nbsp;
bolt would strike him again and cure his illness.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:50.800
However, the plan doesn’t work because Zhen is too&nbsp;
scared to be struck. On their way back home, Zhen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:55.520
thanks Caomei for being nice to him when they were&nbsp;
younger. It turns out that she was the only one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.520 --> 00:07:00.080
who believed him when the principal accused him&nbsp;
of stealing the money. They talk about a yellow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:06.160
umbrella that Caomei used to carry everywhere. She&nbsp;
claims that it was her late mother’s only memory&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:11.920
but someone stole it a few years ago. She curses&nbsp;
the person who stole it not knowing that it was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:17.680
actually Zhen. When he reaches home, he tries to&nbsp;
talk to the umbrella to apologize but it refuses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:22.320
to talk to him. Following that, he brings out&nbsp;
a painting from his stash of stolen stuff.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:28.480
The painting happens to be the Mona Lisa. To check&nbsp;
the authenticity of it, he brings it to a museum&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:33.840
and shows it to artist Adam. Adam is brother Hei’s&nbsp;
customer who has been pressuring him to steal the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:39.360
statue. He disguises his illegal business&nbsp;
using the art gallery. To Zhen’s surprise,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:45.360
Caomei is also at the art gallery. He finds out&nbsp;
that she is dating Adam and leaves right after.
&nbsp;

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:51.040
The next day, Zhen is in the hospital with Caomei.&nbsp;
She has brought a lie-detecting machine wanting to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:56.080
check if he is really telling her the truth. As&nbsp;
they talk, she asks him if he had a crush on her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.080 --> 00:08:01.440
when they were in school. Before Zhen can answer,&nbsp;
someone interrupts them. A few hours later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:06.400
Zhen goes to meet Adam again and finds him&nbsp;
painting a nude picture of a girl. It is clear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:11.600
to him that Adam is cheating on Caomei. Zhen&nbsp;
cannot sleep that night. He contemplates if he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:16.880
should tell Caomei the truth but his house plant&nbsp;
advises him against ruining her relationship.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:21.760
Later that day, Caomei takes Zhen on a hot&nbsp;
air balloon ride to help him with his supposed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:26.880
fear of heights. She has also brought him a&nbsp;
cake, remembering that it is his birthday.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:33.120
Zhen is overwhelmed by the gesture. However, his&nbsp;
happiness doesn’t last long as on their way back,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:38.240
he hears her talk to Adam on the phone.&nbsp;
Following that, Zhen goes to talk to Adam&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:42.640
about the original Mona Lisa painting he&nbsp;
owns but Adam refuses to believe him. 
&nbsp;

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:48.800
When he isn’t looking, Zhen takes the opportunity&nbsp;
to text all his flings on his phone. The next day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:54.480
all the girls, including Caomei, gather and&nbsp;
beat Adam up for playing them. Later that day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.480 --> 00:09:00.000
she goes to a club with Zhen to get her mind off&nbsp;
her ex-boyfriend. They dance and drink the entire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:04.960
night. Zhen brings her to his house because she&nbsp;
is too drunk to drive home. He quickly hides the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:10.320
umbrella so she wouldn’t see it and they spend the&nbsp;
rest of the night watching TV. In the meantime,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:16.240
a jealous Adam goes to brother Hei and shows him&nbsp;
CCTV camera footage of Zhen talking to his phone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:21.520
and asking for the passcode. Adam has been keeping&nbsp;
an eye on him for the past few days and has found&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:27.280
out about his special power. However, brother&nbsp;
Hei doesn’t believe him. Back at Zhen’s home, his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:32.720
belongings start to urge him to tell Caomei about&nbsp;
the umbrella. He gets annoyed by them and goes to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:38.800
the dumping site to meet his old car. It is being&nbsp;
demolished so he wants to say the last goodbye.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:43.760
The man version of the car tells him that it&nbsp;
used to deliberately break down when Zhen went&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:48.400
on a heist because it is the only way the car&nbsp;
could have stopped him from doing bad things.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:52.640
Zhen apologizes for being rude to&nbsp;
him for all those years. They share&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:58.080
an emotional goodbye as the man disappears&nbsp;
into thin air and the car is demolished. 
&nbsp;

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:03.120
Following the encounter, Zhen goes to meet&nbsp;
Caomei and tells her about his powers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:08.400
He also hands her the yellow umbrella and&nbsp;
apologies for taking it. Caomei asks him to talk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:13.760
to the umbrella and tell her what her mother's&nbsp;
last words were. The umbrella refuses to talk,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:20.000
so Caomei doesn’t believe him. She storms off,&nbsp;
furious at his lies. After returning home that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:25.600
day, Zhen looks at his arm and sees that the last&nbsp;
line of the vein that was red has turned normal,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:30.560
meaning that all his debts are paid and he can&nbsp;
no longer talk to things. He gets a call from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:35.680
brother Hei threatening him with Caomei’s&nbsp;
life and asking him to come to a warehouse.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.680 --> 00:10:40.880
Zhen rushes there to find out that Hei wants&nbsp;
him to talk to a locker that contains valuable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:47.760
weapons and find out its passcode. If Zhen fails&nbsp;
to do so, he threatens to kill Caomei. She is hung&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:52.960
from a height on the other side of the room. Zhen&nbsp;
tries to communicate with the locker but cannot.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:58.400
He tells them that he has lost his ability. Hei&nbsp;
is about to shoot him dead but the police arrive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:03.600
at the right time and save both of them. When&nbsp;
Zhen returns home, he looks at his belongings&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:09.280
and reminisces about their constant chattering.&nbsp;
The movie ends as we see Caomei using her yellow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:14.080
umbrella to protect Zhen from the rain. 
